BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 497 Tm (et al. \(2022\) focused on lower extremity muscle strains in NBA athletes and reported that) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 483 Tm (XGBoost outperformed logistic regression for that narrower injury setting. Broader) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 469 Tm (review papers also note that the field still lacks standardized preprocessing, open datasets,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 455 Tm (and consistent evaluation practice. This proposal builds on those observations.) Tj ET
