BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 297 Tm (enough to reproduce and interpretable enough to inspect. The study will compare logistic) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 283 Tm (regression, random forest, and XGBoost against a simple multilayer perceptron baseline. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 269 Tm (final result should show whether classic interpretable models are strong enough to remain) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 255 Tm (competitive in this setting and which feature groups matter most.) Tj ET
