BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 173 Tm (stats.nba.com and Basketball-Reference. Second, it will engineer features such as recent) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 159 Tm (minutes, rolling workload, days of rest, age, position, previous injury counts, and recent) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 72 145 Tm (availability trends. Third, it will train and compare logistic regression, random forest,) Tj ET
